sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant FE as Frontend React
  participant API as FastAPI REST
  participant WS as WebSocket

  U->>FE: Crear clase UML
  FE->>API: POST /uml/diagrams/{id}/classes
  API-->>FE: Clase creada
  FE->>WS: UML_EVENT CREATE_CLASS
  WS-->>FE: EVENT_ACK / broadcast
  U->>FE: Validar diagrama
  FE->>API: POST /uml/diagrams/{id}/validate
  API-->>FE: Errores, advertencias y recomendaciones
